{ The first time I beat an FM. I've known Gunnar since I was a kid, and I actually had a positive score against him after a lucky win in the CO Closed in around 2014. I had struggled to beat NMs recently, see the Brian Wall game at Gryphon, and I was losing a bit of confidence here. Gunnar tried to get away with too much here, foregoing a nice opening advantage, and I eventually punished him after giving him a chance to get out. }
